      "memory_id": "m003",
      "summary": "The user maintains a medium-sized backyard rose garden with the goal of keeping it healthy and blooming, typically through weekly care, and shares a printed checklist with a neighbor. The heirloom rose received from the neighbor is 'Zéphirine Drouhin', a thornless climbing rose with deep pink blooms that is a repeat bloomer but prone to black spot in humid summers; summer care focuses on pruning, feeding, and foliage health. In winter, roses need less attention, so tasks shift to monthly until spring.",
